			"Message": "build(Rest): rebuild Rest binary\n\nRegenerate the Rest bundler binary following the recent CHANGELOG overhaul. The bin/Rest artifact is the compiled output of Rest — the JS bundler that compiles VS Code platform source into bundled trees loaded by Cocoon and Sky.\n\nBinary rebuilt successfully.",
